<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Eat</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>eat &lt;food&gt;
</pre>
<p>It is important that you eat food. Different types of food fill your stomach for 
different time periods, so a cracker is less filling than a big bread, and when 
you are too full to eat more, the game tells you so.
</p><p>When your stomach is nearly empty you start to get messages: you are hungry, 
then very hungry, then starving. Once it is empty you stop healing, and soon you 
start losing hit points instead, more the longer you go hungry. In the end you 
die. Thirst works the same way, so drink as well (see <a cmd='#'>Help Drinks</a>).
</p><p>So remember to carry a little spare food around. In Udgaard, Rosanne's Food 
Store sells bread.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drinks</a>
